OL,3,GNEWSAThe four locations in the running
OL,4,Ato be UK City of Culture 2029
OL,5,
OL,6,FBlackpool, Milton Keynes, Sheffield and
OL,7,FWrexham have been shortlisted to become
OL,8,Fthe UK's City of Culture in 2029.
OL,10,FThe winning location will be announced
OL,11,Fin May and will be the fifth holder of
OL,12,Fthe title - following
OL,13,FDerry-Londonderry, Hull, Coventry and
OL,14,FBradford.
OL,16,FA different location is given the City
OL,17,Fof Culture title every four years. Each
OL,18,Fshortlisted city will now receive at
OL,19,Fleast #125,000 from the government to
OL,20,Fdo further work on their bid.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
